immich-placenames began as a Go port of immich-reversegeo, AGPL-3.0,
https://github.com/immich-reversegeo/immich-reversegeo; see LICENSE.
Carried over from it: internal/overture/profiles.json, its city-resolver
catalog with alpha-2 keys, and the rule tests in
internal/overture/overture_test.go.

The caches under data/ hold Overture Maps data, fetched on the machine
and never committed. Attribution per
https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/:

  (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, Overture Maps Foundation

